coring rule, then test both correct and incorrect answers.","AI 工作流与开发背景","研究作者的知识型战斗提示词如何变成问答、卡牌、回合和连击系统，再通过小范围规则修改观察代理如何维护相互关联的状态。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 生成（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Phaser 3 · TypeScript","engine","lead","2d","ai-generated",[138,139,140,141],{"_61":133,"_25":106,"_17":128},{"_61":123,"_25":74,"_17":118,"_107":124},{"_61":114,"_25":115,"_107":116,"_169":170},{"_61":105,"_25":106,"_107":108},[166,167,168],"opengame","codex-browser-games","playwright-mcp","scope","complete-project",{"_172":173},"documents",{"_66":174,"_35":175},[177,181,182,183,180,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,179,216,178,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234],[176,177,178,179,180],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics","skills/level-design/references/case-studies","skills/level-design/references/combat-balance","sk